  "title": "Grandma's No-Bake Cheesecake",
  "description": "This versatile, easy, no-bake cheesecake from a family recipe can be made ahead of time with just 6 ingredients and served with your choice of topping.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Horrace"
